   "cooked": "<p>This is Soft Gov wg transparency audit. You can check the document and give feedback if something doesn’t look accurate. Thanks Zeptimus and Ivy for making this a very easy and relevant process.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox googledocs\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i0ah8pU6lzcCcRSzAjHnMdqEJC6XXBQu9B-EMMhMp0w/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">docs.google.com</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i0ah8pU6lzcCcRSzAjHnMdqEJC6XXBQu9B-EMMhMp0w/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"googledocs-onebox-logo g-sheets-logo\"></span></a>\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i0ah8pU6lzcCcRSzAjHnMdqEJC6XXBQu9B-EMMhMp0w/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Soft Gov audit DATE 04 13 2021</a></h3>\n<p>General Process\n\nGeneral Process\nFor the audit to be successful, the working groups will prepare the documentation needed to fulfill the audit criteria/checklist. The WG will then answer the audit criteria/checklist and get feedback from members...</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
